// RUN: edaxc run --root=%S/shared_library_project --out-dir=%t app
// A shared Edax library (g.add_shared_library of an edax_target): its functions, methods, globals,
// vtables and type ids are in libcore.so; the program declares them and makes generic instances
// (core::biggest<u32>) itself. Its global is initialized when the library is loaded.
